Do not fabricate actual chat screenshots or claim fictional messages were really exchanged. Use illustrative chat bubbles with clearly authored narrative text.

### Chapter C: The 18th birthday

Transition from the chat timeline into a beautifully illustrated birthday cake.

Implement:

