- Reveal its unique message.
- Allow the birthday girl to write a wish for herself.
- Allow her to write a playful dare for the boy.
- Include an optional message inviting her to reserve a slice for him.
- Display a preview of the message she is about to share.

Provide a "Share With Him" action using an explicit WhatsApp share link or another clearly documented sharing method.

Do not automatically send messages, request unnecessary permissions, or expose private credentials.

